  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to our \"Seaside Treehouse\". This unique beautifully house is available to you. This home is only one block to the Dune Allen Beach and a few minutes walk to Stinky's Fish Restaurant. This home offer 3 bedrooms, 1 bonus room and 2 full bathrooms. 3 Queen beds and 1 twin bed available to you, so there's a place for everyone. You can relax on the front and back of deck after a day of fun on the beach. Our Living room with big TV and sofas. A brand-new refrigerator, and a new electric stove round out a full-service kitchen of oven, stove-top, microwave, coffee makers (individual and pots), and a fully stocked set of plates, silverware, and cooking pots and pans. Enjoy an \"Endless Summer\" in this beautiful, inviting 3 bedroom retreat. Only 1 mile to Gulf Place/Shunk Gulley, and Santa Rosa Golf and Beach Club is just one mile too! <br>Pet Friendly! Minimum Stay 3 night.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Pet Friendly, One Block to Beach!"
        }
      ],
